0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨3,4,-1⟩ & =⟨-2,3,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨3,4,-1⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨3,4,-1⟩ & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute $r=⟨x,y,z⟩$ into the equation above and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨3,4,-1⟩ & =7 \\\\ 3x+4y-z & =7 \\\\ 3x+4y-z-7 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317152 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317153 13194139534883 true] [17592186317152 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317154 13194139534883 true] [17592186317152 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317155 13194139534883 true] [17592186317152 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317156 13194139534883 true] [17592186317152 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317157 13194139534883 true] [17592186317152 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534883 true] [17592186317152 1041 "selection" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317152 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317155 13194139534883 true] [17592186317152 1110 #uuid "39431669-f8b7-5624-822e-3855a0a51429" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317153 1034 "4x-3y-z+13=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317153 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317153 1111 #uuid "74e40a26-493d-5b63-b2a7-b0c0857a63c1" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317154 1034 "4x+3y-z-11=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317154 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317154 1111 #uuid "96600223-6ac2-5aae-af5f-d339a3bf95ee" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317155 1034 "3x+4y-z-7=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317155 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317155 1111 #uuid "8fad3f9f-dd27-58db-96a2-20d9a9edd43f" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317156 1034 "3x-4y-z+9=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317156 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317156 1111 #uuid "cfd52b89-44ba-5ac6-aa3e-ee8390f035fb" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317157 1034 "x+3y-4z-17=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317157 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317157 1111 #uuid "83c33c72-a071-596b-90b3-cb3ce07d269b" 1