 #uuid "8cbb9ba9-50e9-5a94-a501-7a9ce40ae41e" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317172 1145 "First, from the equation of the plane we get that the normal vector of $Π$ is $n=⟨4,4,-2⟩.$\n\nNow, we solve the Cartesian equation of $Π$ for $z$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4x+4y-2z & =0 \\\\ 2z & =4x+4y \\\\ z & =2x+2y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we put, say, $x=0$ and $y=0$, we get $z=0.$ Hence, the point $P(0,0,0)$ lies on $Π.$ Note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=⟨0,0,0⟩.$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ (r-⟨0,0,0⟩)\\cdot ⟨4,4,-2⟩ & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317173 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317174 13194139534883 true] [17592186317173 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317175 13194139534883 true] [17592186317173 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317176 13194139534883 true] [17592186317173 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317177 13194139534883 true] [17592186317173 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317178 13194139534883 true] [17592186317173 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534883 true] [17592186317173 1041 "selection" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317173 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317175 13194139534883 true] [17592186317173 1110 #uuid "c922b201-a92f-5395-b5f0-4c722b17bf84" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317174 1034 "(r-⟨0,0,1⟩)\\cdot ⟨2,4,-4⟩=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317174 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317174 1111 #uuid "bb8e7568-047d-5e41-b63c-205aaff1af1d" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317175 1034 "(r-⟨0,0,0⟩)\\cdot ⟨4,4,-2⟩=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317175 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317175 1111 #uuid "5f0aba5a-fa9a-5bb1-887a-0103271ca435" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317176 1034 "(r-⟨0,0,-2⟩)\\cdot ⟨-4,4,-2⟩=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317176 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317176 1111 #uuid "7c11b77b-6e9b-500f-a0e8-cc24d11fa912" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317177 1034 "(r-⟨0,0,2⟩)\\cdot ⟨4,4,2⟩=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317177 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317177 1111 #uuid "a190fab2-2f20-5523-a7aa-681ffd89d3e9" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317178 1034 "(r-⟨0,0,0⟩)\\cdot ⟨4,-2,4⟩=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317178 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317178 1111 #uuid "ad939636-b869-5138-9191-4d02b30ce1d0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317179 1017 #edb/ref 17592186317180 13194139534883 true] [17592186317179 1089 "q-128462" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317179 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534883 true] [17592186317179 1100 "Find a Cartesian equation of the plane that passes through the points $A(1,-2,3)$, $P(3,-1,4)$ and $Q(-1,0,1).$" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317179 1113 #uuid "47e868ac-1a14-516c-8ec1-ee1245087be0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317179 1145 "Note that the position vectors of the points $A,P$ and $Q$ are $a=⟨1,-2,3⟩,\\,p=⟨3,-1,4⟩,$ and $q=⟨-1,0,1⟩.$\n\nFirst, using the $3$ points we build $2$ vectors parallel to the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{v}_{1} & =\\overset{\\to }{AP} \\\\  & =⟨3,-1,4⟩-⟨1,-2,3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,1,1⟩ \\\\ {v}_{2} & =\\overset{\\to }{AQ} \\\\  & =⟨-1,0,1⟩-⟨1,-2,3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,2,-2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNow,  we need to find the normal vector of the plane. To do that, we use the cross product of ${v}_{1}$ and ${v}_{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & ={v}_{1}\\times {v}_{2} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\times [\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =-4i+2j+6k \\\\  & =⟨-4,2,6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the dot product, we can find the equation of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-4,2,6⟩ & =⟨3,-1,4⟩\\cdot ⟨-4,2,6⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-4,2,6⟩ & =10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute $r=⟨x,y,z⟩$ into the equation above and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨-4,2,6⟩ & =10 \\\\ -4x+2y+6z & =10 \\\\ -4x+2y+6z-10 & =0 \\\\ 4x-2y-6z+10 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317180 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317181 13194139534883 true] [17592186317180 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317182 13194139534883 true] [17592186317180 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317183 13194139534883 true] [17592186317180 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317184 13194139534883 true] [17592186317180 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317185 13194139534883 true] [17592186317180 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534883 true] [17592186317180 1041 "selection" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317180 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317183 13194139534883 true] [17592186317180 1110 #uuid "bb782205-3c0e-5252-aaed-f4e705886e25" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317181 1034 "2x-4y-6z+13=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317181 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317181 1111 #uuid "cb6deb97-f107-513f-bf32-dc40eb368827" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317182 1034 "4x-2y+6z+21=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317182 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317182 1111 #uuid "e7578732-1ace-5b8a-8787-a9fafc50a085" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317183 1034 "4x-2y-6z+10=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317183 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317183 1111 #uuid "3760cdfe-ae3b-5f58-9fd1-75cc52efa930" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317184 1034 "4x-6y-2z+7=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317184 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317184 1111 #uuid "022a6212-0f64-54db-b3d3-2da1d509da81" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317185 1034 "4x-6y-2z+17=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317185 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317185 1111 #uuid "743c7d2e-4f2c-54de-98d2-fde03125c7eb" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317186 1017 #edb/ref 17592186317187 13194139534883 true] [17592186317186 1089 "q-330498" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317186 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534883 true] [17592186317