 [17592186317200 1145 "First, we note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=⟨2,-1,3⟩.$ From the vectorial equation, we find that the line is parallel to the vector $⟨1,-4,2⟩.$ So, the normal vector of the plane is \n\n$$\nn=⟨1,-4,2⟩.\n$$\n\nUsing the dot product, we can find the equation of the plane as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨1,-4,2⟩ & =⟨2,-1,3⟩\\cdot ⟨1,-4,2⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨1,-4,2⟩ & =12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute $r=⟨x,y,z⟩$ into the equation above. Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨1,-4,2⟩ & =12 \\\\ x-4y+2z & =12 \\\\ x-4y+2z-12 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317201 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317202 13194139534883 true] [17592186317201 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534883 true] [17592186317201 1041 "field-1" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317201 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317202 13194139534883 true] [17592186317201 1110 #uuid "f11793dc-6a93-59ef-8ce8-cbd1fa85f5f1" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317202 1034 "4" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317202 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317202 1111 #uuid "66c7b0e9-84e8-5c9c-ba0f-06626ea8fc1f" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317203 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317204 13194139534883 true] [17592186317203 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534883 true] [17592186317203 1041 "field-2" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317203 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317204 13194139534883 true] [17592186317203 1110 #uuid "7a2f3885-c732-5ca3-999a-26db1ceab88e" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317204 1034 "2" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317204 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317204 1111 #uuid "f5a9a64d-1ad8-5fd9-a7ff-e1842bd77ed0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317205 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317206 13194139534883 true] [17592186317205 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534883 true] [17592186317205 1041 "field-3" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317205 110