$$\n\nFinally, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute $r=⟨x,y,z⟩$ into the equation above and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨-10,4,11⟩ & =-17 \\\\ -10x+4y+11z & =-17 \\\\ 10x-4y-11z & =17 \\\\ 10x-4y-11z-17 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317226 13194139534883 true] [17592186317225 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534883 true] [17592186317225 1041 "field-1" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317225 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317226 13194139534883 true] [17592186317225 1110 #uuid "ab4131f0-8a86-5a6d-9a7a-9c289d4385df" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317226 1034 "10" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317226 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317226 1111 #uuid "0f761c95-9f32-5612-9e67-fa0df18faa72" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317227 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317228 13194139534883 true] [17592186317227 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534883 true] [17592186317227 1041 "field-2" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317227 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317228 13194139534883 true] [17592186317227 1110 #uuid "4a0c38fd-9fd4-586f-8f30-60515009bbae" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317228 1034 "4" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317228 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317228 1111 #uuid "3b52ffa4-2203-571f-bd8f-3a50604af33a" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317229 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317230 13194139534883 true] [17592186317229 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534883 true] [17592186317229 1041 "field-3" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317229 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317230 13194139534883 true] [17592186317229 1110 #uuid "7741f7f0-ea69-5bb6-a42d-31ee48de0e0b" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317230 1034 "17" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317230 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317230 1111 #uuid "e8280fec-4a53-5c0b-bb76-2e7f9a245174" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317231 1017 #edb/ref 17592186317232 13194139534883 true] [17592186317231 1089 "q-336538" 131941