94139534883 true] [17592186317239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317241 13194139534883 true] [17592186317239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317242 13194139534883 true] [17592186317239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317243 13194139534883 true] [17592186317239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317244 13194139534883 true] [17592186317239 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534883 true] [17592186317239 1041 "selection" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317239 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317244 13194139534883 true] [17592186317239 1110 #uuid "cf0c30f9-503f-5f2d-a8e9-ee837e0cad11" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317240 1034 "x+4y-2z+13=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317240 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317240 1111 #uuid "8a2f592a-f2ae-5741-8d47-7969dbee99b8" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317241 1034 "x+4y+z+10=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317241 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317241 1111 #uuid "4699547e-7d88-5c79-a05c-aa4be50457b4" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317242 1034 "2x+5y+14=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317242 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317242 1111 #uuid "9763fa43-49a8-54ac-8327-c39ace4eca59" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317243 1034 "x-4y+z+14=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317243 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317243 1111 #uuid "be4bd53d-fa87-5296-9a6e-87f6fbc468e0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317244 1034 "x+4y+14=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317244 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317244 1111 #uuid "725e3432-c3d0-5d91-a7ce-4c07a9ca263d" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317245 1017 #edb/ref 17592186317246 13194139534883 true] [17592186317245 1089 "q-33913" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317245 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534883 true] [17592186317245 1100 "Find a Cartesian equation of the plane that passes through the points $A(1,-1,1)$, $P(2,0,3)$ and $Q(1,1,0).$" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317245 1113 #uuid "08692043-b7cd-55e2-b86c-6bc1b3ef2402" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317245 1145 "Note that the position vectors of the points $A,P$ and $Q$ are $a=⟨1,-1,1⟩,\\,p=⟨2,0,3⟩,$ and $q=⟨1,1,0⟩.$\n\nFirst, using the $3$ points we build $2$ vectors parallel to the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{v}_{1} & =\\overset{\\to }{AP} \\\\  & =⟨2,0,3⟩-⟨1,-1,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,1,2⟩ \\\\ {v}_{2} & =\\overset{\\to }{AQ} \\\\  & =⟨1,1,0⟩-⟨1,-1,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,2,-1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNow, we need to find the normal vector of the plane. To do that, we use the cross product of ${v}_{1}$ and ${v}_{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & ={v}_{1}\\times {v}_{2} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\times [\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -1\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =-5i+j+2k \\\\  & =⟨-5,1,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the dot product, we can find the equation of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-5,1,2⟩ & =⟨2,0,3⟩\\cdot ⟨-5,1,2⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-5,1,2⟩ & =-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute $r=⟨x,y,z⟩$ into the equation above and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨-5,1,2⟩ & =-4 \\\\ -5x+y+2z & =-4 \\\\ -5x+y+2z+4 & =0 \\\\ 5x-y-2z-4 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317246 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317247 13194139534883 true] [17592186317246 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317248 13194139534883 true] [17592186317246 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317249 13194139534883 true] [17592186317246 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317250 13194139534883 true] [17592186317246 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317251 13194139534883 true] [17592186317246 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534883 true] [17592186317246 1041 "selection" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317246 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317247 13194139534883 true] [17592186317246 1110 #uuid "62c73c61-084f-598f-9a26-388093e5eff2" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317247 1034 "5x-y-2z-4=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317247 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317247 1111 #uuid "8e65e2a5-4979-5ab2-9acf-68f15e9f61d9" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317248 1034 "2x+3z-4=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317248 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317248 1111 #uuid "38dffdf1-e644-5aaa-b63e-e6af6c9fd7f4" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317249 1034 "5x-y-2z=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317249 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317249 1111 #uuid "41f418f9-fa65-521c-86aa-8bdf00e2e80a" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317250 1034 "x-y-4=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317250 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317250 1111 #uuid "8b1ba502-ab3e-5eae-8458-38a8e266b715" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317251 1034 "x-y+z+4=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317251 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317251 1111 #uuid "43158893-8356-5c63-8f19-44104e38a3c1" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317252 1017 #edb/ref 17592186317253 13194139534883 true] [17592186317252 1089 "q-70809" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317252 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534883 true] [17592186317252 1100 "Find a Cartesian equation of the plane that passes through the point $P(2,3,-1)$ and is perpendicular to the line \n$r=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317252 1113 #uuid "a01c8d0c-708e-5a28-b9ae-1414f36e9dc9" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317252 1145 "First, we note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=⟨2,3,-1⟩.$ From the vectorial equation, we find that the line is parallel to the vector $⟨3,2,-2⟩.$ So, the normal vector of the plane is \n\n$$\nn=⟨3,2,-2⟩.\n$$\n\nUsing the dot product, we can find the equation of the plane as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨3,2,-2⟩ & =⟨2,3,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨3,2,-2⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨3,2,-2⟩ & =14.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute $r=⟨x,y,z⟩$ into the equation above. Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨3,2,-2⟩ & =14 \\\\ 3x+2y-2z & =14 \\\\ 3x+2y-2z-14 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317254 13194139534883 true] [17592186317253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317255 13194139534883 true] [17592186317253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317256 13194139534883 true] [17592186317253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317257 13194139534883 true] [17592186317253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317258 13194139534883 true] [17592186317253 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534883 true] [17592186317253 1041 "selection" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317253 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317256 13194139534883 true] [17592186317253 1110 #uuid "11e75fd7-4368-5648-a1cc-04738d2cfcc2" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317254 1034 "3x+2y-2z-2=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317254 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317254 1111 #uuid "7d089bd5-bc73-50b4-9789-cefe8e13dd73" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317255 1034 "-2x+y+z-2=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317255 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317255 1111 #uuid "99b50b55-44c9-5578-806b-352c17204190" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317256 1034 "3x+2y-2z-14=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317256 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317256 1111 #uuid "64cba4dd-9dc5-53ef-acae-98028b7c263b" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317257 1034 "2x+3y-z-14=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317257 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317257 1111 #uuid "6e65ef75-b03c-52a9-aa96-50477a3fa84f" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317258 1034 "2x-z-14=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317258 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317258 1111 #uuid "1ed7e429-d015-5de3-9015-5a55d26ad276" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317259 1017 #edb/ref 17592186317260 13194139534883 true] [17592186317259 1089 "q-70818" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317259 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534883 true] [17592186317259 1100 "Given the Cartesian equation $2x+y-2z-4=0$ of the plane $Π$, find an equation of $Π$ in the form $(r-p)\\cdot n=0.$" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317259 1113 #uuid "73c1d5d9-6a23-5438-8d9f-6779511254e9" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317259 1145 "First, from the equation of the plane we get that the normal vector of $Π$ is $n=⟨2,1,-2⟩.$\n\nNow, we solve the Cartesian equation of $Π$ for $z$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x+y-2z-4 & =0 \\\\ -2z & =-2x-y+4 \\\\ z & =x+\\frac{1}{2}y-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we put, say, $x=0$ and $y=0$, we get $z=-2.$ Hence, the point $P(0,0,-2)$ lies on $Π.$ Note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=⟨0,0,-2⟩.$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ (r-⟨0,0,-2⟩)\\cdot ⟨2,1,-2⟩ & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317261 13194139534883 true] [17592186317260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317262 13194139534883 true] [17592186317260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317263 13194139534883 true] [17592186317260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317264 13194139534883 true] [17592186317260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186317265 13194139534883 true] [17592186317260 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534883 true] [17592186317260 1041 "selection" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317260 1104 #edb/ref 17592186317264 13194139534883 true] [17592186317260 1110 #uuid "4c8bc945-f185-55c7-ac41-b7612c981ac6" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317261 1034 "(r-⟨0,0,2⟩)\\cdot ⟨1,0,-1⟩=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317261 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317261 1111 #uuid "420c5cf1-e38b-555d-8f2d-5c1be19e580b" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317262 1034 "(r-⟨0,0,-2⟩)\\cdot ⟨2,0,-2⟩=0" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317262 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534883 true] [17592186317262 1111 #uuid "4f20ac7c-1521-57ab-85fc-0223dd47a1c5" 13194139534883 true] [17592186317263 10